            <h2>Chicken Biryani</h2>

            <p><strong>Recipe ID :</strong> 1</p>

            <p><strong>Category :</strong> Non-Veg</p>

            <p><strong>Author :</strong> Rahul</p>

            <p><strong>Cooking Time :</strong> 45 Minutes</p>

            <p><strong>Difficulty :</strong> Medium</p>

            <p><strong>Total Views :</strong> 520</p>

            <hr>

            <h3>Ingredients</h3>

            <ul>

                <li>Chicken</li>

                <li>Basmati Rice</li>

                <li>Onion</li>

                <li>Tomato</li>

                <li>Curd</li>

                <li>Spices</li>

                <li>Mint Leaves</li>

                <li>Coriander Leaves</li>

            </ul>

            <hr>

            <h3>Preparation Steps</h3>

            <ol>

                <li>Wash and marinate the chicken.</li>

                <li>Cook basmati rice until half done.</li>

                <li>Prepare masala with onions, tomatoes and spices.</li>

                <li>Add marinated chicken and cook well.</li>

                <li>Layer rice and chicken masala.</li>

                <li>Cook on low flame for 20 minutes.</li>

                <li>Garnish with mint and coriander.</li>

                <li>Serve hot.</li>

            </ol>

